    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just the lack of control that gets to me. watching everything fade bit by bit, losing my strength, losing my mind... it feels so undignified. like i'm just a passenger in a wreck that's taking its sweet time to happen. i wish i could just decide when the story ends instead of just watching the pages rot.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
